# Written for rpi-image-gen layer mp-hmi-kiosk.
#
# The panel session reads the touch screen itself, for the swipe from the top
# edge that brings the panel down (lisgd, mp-kiosk-gestures). Only the touch
# screen, and only for the session on the seat: logind gives the user of the
# active session an ACL, as it does for a camera or a sound card. Keyboards
# stay closed, which the input group would open. Before 73-seat-late.rules,
# which applies the tag.
SUBSYSTEM=="input", KERNEL=="event*", ENV{ID_INPUT_TOUCHSCREEN}=="1", TAG+="uaccess", SYMLINK+="input/mp-touchscreen"
